      "text": "Meeting  at the airport and transfer to your hotel in Santa Cruz.\n\nIn the afternoon, a city tour, visiting the main 14 de Septiembre street with a close view of the Minor Basilica of San Lorenzo, a visit to Campo Arte (craft store), a tour of the popular El Abasto market, walks through the main monuments and residential neighborhoods of the city. The tour ends with a typical coffee. Return to the hotel. Night at Hotel LP Equipetrol. ",
